  "id": "compatibility",
  "term": "compatibility",
  "definition": "In social psychology, compatibility is a proposed partner quality referring to how well another person fits the broader needs someone hopes a romantic or sexual relationship will meet. It is described as a distinct aspect of mate preference beyond physical attractiveness, interpersonal warmth, and social status.",
