      "reasons": [
        "The packet only states that compatibility may be an omission from the set of three primary partner qualities (physical attractiveness, interpersonal warmth, social status); it does not define compatibility as “how well another person fits the broader needs someone hopes a romantic or sexual relationship will meet.”",
